he release-age cooldown on available wheels.\n\nI need to figure out what's actually constraining pymilvus in the pipeline—whether it's coming from langchain-milvus or elsewhere—and whether there's a way to pin it to an older version that has sdists available. The logs confirm that langchain-milvus was just added to the collection, and since all pymilvus 3.x versions are within the 3-day cooldown window, the solution is to wait for that period to expire before retrying the pipeline.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8432,"cache_read_input_tokens":49004,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8432,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77a3f021-627e-47e4-9986-5fd96a09bf56","uuid":"5ca6cede-c04a-45e9-9011-ea3126a5e67c","timestamp":"2026-07-20T22:06:36.314Z","request_id":"req_vrtx_011CdE4vCB1hEy8MnCe3Zt2U"}
