n-readable one-line summary of the error.\"\n48\t    },\n49\t    \"suggested_resolution_summary\": {\n50\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n51\t      \"description\": \"One-line summary of the suggested fix.\"\n52\t    },\n53\t    \"has_resolution_file\": {\n54\t      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n55\t      \"description\": \"Whether a sections/resolution.md file exists with detailed resolution steps.\"\n56\t    },\n57\t    \"confidence\": {\n58\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n59\t      \"enum\": [\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"],\n60\t      \"description\": \"Confidence level in the root-cause diagnosis.\"\n61\t    },\n62\t    \"confidence_justification\": {\n63\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n64\t      \"description\": \"Evidence and reasoning supporting the confidence level.\"\n65\t    },\n66\t    \"cascade\": {\n67\t      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n68\t      \"description\": \"Whether this failure cascades from an upstream failure rather than being an independent root cause.\"\n69\t    },\n70\t    \"group_consistency\": {\n71\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n72\t      \"enum\": [\"consistent\", \"mixed\"],\n73\t      \"description\": \"Whether all jobs show the same error symptoms ('consistent') or exhibit different error manifestations despite sharing a root cause ('mixed'). Same root cause with variant-specific symptoms = 'mixed'.\"\n74\t    },\n75\t    \"feedback_status\": {\n76\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n77\t      \"enum\": [\"included\", \"not_applicable\"],\n78\t      \"description\": \"Whether workflow feedback was written. 'included' when feedback.md was written, 'not_applicable' when no process observations apply.\"\n79\t    },\n80\t    \"references\": {\n81\t      \"type\": \"array\",\n82\t      \"items\": {\n83\t        \"type\": \"object\",\n84\t        \"required\": [\"path\"],\n85\t        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n86\t        \"properties\": {\n87\t          \"path\": {\n88\t            \"type\": \"string\",\n89\t            \"description\": \"Canonical repository path consulted during analysis.\"\n90\t          },\n91\t          \"description\": {\n92\t            \"type\": \"string\",\n93\t            \"description\": \"How this reference was used during the investigation and what insight it provided.\"\n94\t          }\n95\t        }\n96\t      },\n97\t      \"description\": \"Repository files consulted during analysis, with descriptions of how each was used.\"\n98\t    },\n99\t    \"target_repo\": {\n100\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n101\t      \"format\": \"uri\",\n102\t      \"description\": \"Full URL of the GitLab repository where the fix should be applied (e.g. 'https://gitlab.com/redhat/rhel-ai/rhai/pipeline'). Omit when the fix location is unclear or no code fix exists.\"\n103\t    },\n104\t    \"target_repo_reason\": {\n105\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n106\t      \"description\": \"1-2 sentence justification for why target_repo was chosen (e.g. which files need changing and why they live in that repo).\"\n107\t    },\n108\t    \"resources_used\": {\n109\t      \"type\": \"object\",\n110\t      \"description\": \"Workspace resources consulted during analysis.\",\n111\t      \"required\": [\"agent_docs\", \"skills\", \"tools\"],\n112\t      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n113\t      \"properties\": {\n114\t        \"agent_docs\": {\n115\t          \"type\": \"array\",\n116\t          \"items\": {\n117\t            \"type\": \"object\",\n118\t            \"required\": [\"name\"],\n119\t            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n120\t            \"properties\": {\n121\t              \"name\": {\n122\t                \"type\": \"string\",\n123\t                \"description\": \"Agent documentation filename (e.g. 'package-constraints.md').\"\n124\t              },\n125\t              \"description\": {\n126\t                \"type\": \"string\",\n127\t                \"description\": \"How this documentation was used and what insight it provided.\"\n128\t              }\n129\t            }\n130\t          }